# 统一 LF：Windows 检出不再产生 CRLF 噪音
# 二进制与构建产物显式标注，避免被当成文本做行尾转换
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.xpi binary
*.aar binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.syso binary

# 构建脚本按平台保留原行尾
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
